# VerifyHub — environment variables for the RENDER bot worker.
# These are set in the Render dashboard (worker → Environment), NOT in a
# file and NEVER in git. render.yaml already declares them; when you deploy
# the Blueprint, Render asks you for the sync:false ones.
#
# BOT_TOKEN         — from @BotFather. SAME token as on Hostinger.
# BOT_USERNAME      — Testing_joinbot (without @)
# MINI_APP_URL      — https://glaxfy.in/frontend/
# REGISTRATION_URL  — https://www.dmplay20.com/#/register?invitationCode=77254102278
# DATABASE_URL      — set AUTOMATICALLY by render.yaml (fromDatabase).
#                     Do not type it by hand — it is the INTERNAL URL,
#                     which only works inside Render's network.
# PYTHON_VERSION    — 3.12.0 (already set in render.yaml)
